d 'IDXNL': module to provide nonlinear and interactive modelling with index covariates
d
d   idxnl provides tools for specifying, comparing and interpreting
d nonlinear and interactive regression models in which a covariate
d is a composite index (for example, governance, ICT development or
d institutional quality indicators). Such indices are bounded,
d arbitrarily scaled and often thin in the tails, so a significant
d squared term is frequently read as a turning point that the data
d cannot support 
d
d KW: index variables
d KW: turning point
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261110
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
d Author: Francis Baidoo, Koforidua Technical University
d Support: email ytoyinyusuf@@gmail.com
d
f idxnl.sthlp
f idxdescribe.ado
f idxdescribe.sthlp
f idxint.ado
f idxint.sthlp
f idxnl_cert.do
f idxnl_example.dta
f idxnl_examples.do
f idxspec.ado
f idxspec.sthlp
f idxtp.ado
f idxtp.sthlp
f ../_/_idxnl_cd.ado
f ../_/_idxnl_dkrepost.ado
f ../_/_idxspec_iv.ado
f ../_/_idxspec_simex.ado
f ../_/_idxtp_core.ado
f ../r/run_idxnl_certification.do
